\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces GroundedHuman infers metric calibration and human placement from implicit interaction representations. Body-Anchored Scene Query encodes human--scene correspondence, whose metric readout calibrates scene depth and camera translation. Within this reference, Hierarchical Context Attention encodes regional relations, whose placement readout updates whole-body translation. Updating the body changes its relation to the scene, so the regional representation is recomputed before the next refinement step.}}{5}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:method-overview}{{2}{5}{GroundedHuman infers metric calibration and human placement from implicit interaction representations. Body-Anchored Scene Query encodes human--scene correspondence, whose metric readout calibrates scene depth and camera translation. Within this reference, Hierarchical Context Attention encodes regional relations, whose placement readout updates whole-body translation. Updating the body changes its relation to the scene, so the regional representation is recomputed before the next refinement step}{figure.2}{}}
